# Text files are checked out with LF line endings everywhere, Windows included,
# whatever core.autocrlf says: the app serves its files byte for byte, and tests
# compare them. (tests/fixtures/logseq-graph keeps its CRLF test data on purpose.)
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
*.msg binary
*.pst binary
*.woff2 binary
